   363	* `H^{ab} = Z = G^{ab}`, and the inclusion `H^{ab} -> G^{ab}` is an
   364	  isomorphism (some conjugate of `m` fixes sheet 1, so `H` surjects onto
   365	  `G^{ab}`); transfer then only reproduces `x |-> 4x`. No contradiction.
   366	* `chi(C^2\E) = 4k = 4 · chi(C^2\A_F)`: the degree-4 identity, vacuous.
   367	* The `delta`-budget `delta(p,q) + sum_i t_i + delta_infty = (n-1)(n-2)/2`
