+ahead of further bounded cages. The positive portfolio should deliberately try
+to make either arrow exist: lift the A2 ray by an elementary-matrix recurrence,
+or realize the rigid `N=4` (B3) curve-plus-cover package. A failure of either is
+already a theorem-shaped obstruction; a success is still only the next typed
+state, never a counterexample by declaration.
