+# Blind ideation submission — round 20260902T0741Z (sol56)
+
+## 0. Custody, scope, and typing
+
+The frozen input hashed to
+`2646ac692c292c30597f9c830fd145c85e020207d803927825b8a162086055cf`,
+exactly as charged. I read no `ideation-20260902T0741Z-*` sibling report, log,
