+| 2, sheet-number / boundary trees | **raise** | It now supplies an all-`N`, exact-`H2` profile theorem and closes large species rather than isolated books. Its limit—the absence of a cofinal ceiling—is now proved visible rather than conjectural `[M:413-476]`. |
