+4. Prove one of two exact statements: either a pivot/terminal polynomial is
+   nonzero for every `t>0`, forcing `H'=0` and `U=3e+2`; or every exceptional
+   factor forces a previously killed chamber/wall. Then the finite-cell engine
+   is licensed. If the generic block remains deficient, the proof attack has
