+## 5. Strongest proof attack
+
+Run `FULL-EO / SL2-TOP-DOWN`, not another monotone cell window.
+
+1. Return to the declared quotient
+   `R=C[A,U,Z]/(U^2-A-A^2Z)` and the exact normal forms
+   `f=P+UQ`, `g=R_0+US_0`. The complete constant-J condition is the two
