+
+The campaign is one theorem from making the **A2 subproblem finite**, not one
+theorem from JC2. `H2` means exactly that `A_F` is irreducible `[M:26-30]`; its
+complement is reducible `A_F`. Under H2, smooth is empty at all `N`, B1 is empty
