+## 8. Detailed idea cards
+
+### Card 1 — `FULL-EO / SL2-TERMINATION`
+
+**Dependencies:** exact source `E/O`, ray ring map, legal opens, and the
+`SL_2(C[Z])` reduction. **Cheapest discriminator:** maximal minors of the full
+generic newest-coefficient block for `t=(U-3e-2)/2>0`. **Outcomes:** nonzero
