+I reframe the frontier around two questions. First, is A2's `U` geometric
+complexity or merely the length of a unimodular/continued-fraction
+presentation? Second, can any survivor traverse a declared state arrow—cell to
+analytic pullback, curve representation to global cover/source, or companion
