+   pullback or realized `N>=6` curve plus complete cover.
+2. **A2 finite termination**, not merely an all-order formal solution.
+3. **Preflighted `N=6` actual-curve census**; a tuple zero is not row coverage.
+4. **Joint reducible realization** with common infinity and source-open boundary;
