+
+**Dependencies:** exact source `E/O`, ray ring map, legal opens, and the
+`SL_2(C[Z])` reduction. **Cheapest discriminator:** reduce `DET-EO` and then
+the exact `A0 | B0` remainder after the wall/top-two pins, before forming the
+full newest-coefficient block. **Outcomes:** a nonzero constant is a proof
+lead; discrete finite roots bound that branch; compatible identities expose
+the shooter recurrence, but a terminating solution is only `FULL_EO_POINT`;
+missing map/leader is `OPEN`. **Stop:** after the generic branch split—no more
+Mason-only or monotone-cell work. **Information gain:** **extreme**, because
+obstruction, recurrence, and presentation length separate in one calculation.
+
