+Any reconstruction still branches on `A0=sC1-qE1=0`. On `A0!=0`, compute the
+reduced Bezout pair in `C[Z]`, require zero remainder in O0, reconstruct the
+derivatives `p',r'`, and check their declared source images. A nonzero constant
