+## 10. Campaign-systems check
+
+### UPGRADE — make encoding faithfulness a hard launch gate
+
+The packet calls PREFLIGHT the tracked upgrade `[P:135-145]`; promote it from
+queued hygiene to a prerequisite for every `N>=6` realization job. This is not
+ceremonial: all six earlier nodal ideals used unfaithful raw/sliced coefficient
+conditions, including two apparent two-engine EMPTY results
+(`xmodel/encoding-faithfulness-audit-r2-sol56-20260901.md:189-215`).
+
+**Smallest useful test.** Before solver launch, the generator must (i) emit the
+reduced approximate root beside the ideal in the declared coefficient ring and
+order; (ii) exact-diff each encoded coefficient condition; (iii) make the old
+`(8,6,19)` false-positive canary fail the corrected `86A` cell; (iv) make the
+explicit four-node `(9,6,2)` curve pass corrected `96B`; and (v) fail closed on
+any ring, map, open-factor, or generator-order mismatch. The corrected ideals
+and semantic controls already exist
+`[xmodel/encoding-faithfulness-audit-r2-sol56-20260901.md:462-511]`.
+
+Use two orthogonal output fields, not the draft's lossy single enum:
+
+```text
+artifact = NUMERICAL_PROFILE | FORMAL_EO_SERIES | SUBSYSTEM_POINT |
+           FULL_EO_POINT | CURVE | REPRESENTATION | FULL_COVER |
+           POLYNOMIAL_PAIR
+attainment = NECESSARY | REALIZED | ADMISSIBLE_PULLBACK |
+             ACTUAL_MAP | COUNTEREXAMPLE_CERTIFIED
+```
+
+A checked transition table must reject “A2 cell -> B3 kill”, “local torsion ->
+global torsion”, and `FULL_EO_POINT -> ACTUAL_MAP` without every Section 6
+arrow. Add old-`EQ2_even`/missing-`-2qE1` as a source-fidelity canary. This
+small type check protects both analytic and curve workflows.
+
+## 11. Allocation, falsifiers, and close
+
+Allocate frontier effort in this order: (1) independent review and ledger merge
+of the A2 P0 and all-`N` case-(A) closure; (2) corrected WALL-PIN/DEV-RESULTANT
+and its exceptional branches; (3) one `Gamma` test of a singular-preimage B3 invariant;
+(4) a preflighted B2/B3/reducible `N=6` census, with prime seven only if it
+shrinks that queue; (5) joint companion/source-open completion.
+
+The portfolio changes direction on clear falsifiers. If independent source
+expansion does not reproduce `-2qE1`, quarantine `[AU]`; if it does, retire all
+old wall verdicts. If either case-(A) proof loses a source hypothesis, reopen
+only that chain. If the `c`-eliminant vanishes, study the dependency instead of
+calling `U` bounded. If a B3 invariant misses `Gamma`'s singular preimage or
+Euler ledger, archive it. If curve preflight fails, launch no solver.
+
+The central conclusion is deliberately negative about architecture: exact
+finite windows cannot resolve JC2. The next work must either expose a cofinal
+invariant or advance a survivor through a declared state arrow. Everything
+else is calibration.

