+### UPGRADE — make encoding faithfulness a hard launch gate
+
+The packet calls PREFLIGHT the tracked upgrade `[P:135-145]`; promote it from
+queued hygiene to a prerequisite for every `N>=6` realization job. This is not
+ceremonial: all six earlier nodal ideals used unfaithful raw/sliced coefficient
+conditions, including two apparent two-engine EMPTY results
+(`xmodel/encoding-faithfulness-audit-r2-sol56-20260901.md:189-215`).
+
+**Smallest useful test.** Before solver launch, the generator must (i) emit the
+reduced approximate root beside the ideal in the declared coefficient ring and
+order; (ii) exact-diff each encoded coefficient condition; (iii) make the old
+`(8,6,19)` false-positive canary fail the corrected `86A` cell; (iv) make the
+explicit four-node `(9,6,2)` curve pass corrected `96B`; and (v) fail closed on
+any ring, map, open-factor, or generator-order mismatch. The corrected ideals
+and semantic controls already exist
+`[xmodel/encoding-faithfulness-audit-r2-sol56-20260901.md:462-511]`.
+
+Use two orthogonal output fields, not the draft's lossy single enum:
+
