+```text
+eta^2 | (s^2+X),       eta | (3a s^2+Y),
+s | (q partial_Z(r)-kappa/2).
+```
+
+Set `r=(s^2+X)/(4b eta^2)`, `q=(3a s^2+Y)/(4b^2 eta)`; the last quotient is
+`partial_Z(p)`, which must integrate to the declared `p` in characteristic
+zero. Check all three in the declared coefficient ring, branching on vanished
+leaders and zero. Only then label `SUBSYSTEM_POINT`. Search exceptional `c`,
+full `OPEN[A2-K2E]`, and Chambers I/III separately. This outranks
+an undifferentiated `S_6` search because a landed full solution has an explicit
+route toward a polynomial pair, whereas a permutation tuple does not.
